stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Disconnected
  Disconnected --> InPresenceLobby: auth sign-in + lobby join
  InPresenceLobby --> HostingParty: auto — create solo Relay
  InPresenceLobby --> Disconnected: sign-out / net loss
  HostingParty --> InParty: session live (solo or joiner connected)
  InParty --> Inviting: sent first invite (no NM change)
  InParty --> JoiningParty: accepted invite (leave own Relay)
  InParty --> HostingParty: leave party — recreate solo
  InParty --> Reconnecting: connection lost
  Inviting --> InParty: invites cancelled / joiner connected
  Inviting --> HostingParty: acceptance signal (legacy)
  Inviting --> Reconnecting: lobby lost
  JoiningParty --> InParty: Relay join + NM connect
  JoiningParty --> HostingParty: join failed — recreate solo
  JoiningParty --> Reconnecting: dropped mid-join
  Reconnecting --> InParty: rejoin succeeded
  Reconnecting --> HostingParty: recovery — recreate solo

  note right of InParty
    Persistent baseline:
    every player always has
    a live Relay session
  end note
